**Environment:** z440.atl.core 7.18.0, .NET 10, Windows 11

These are two small ID3v2 things I noticed while testing. They're minor, so I've put them together.

### 1. ID3v2.3: day and month (`TDAT`) written but not read back
```csharp
Settings.ID3v2_tagSubVersion = 3;
var t = new Track("song.mp3");
t.Date = new DateTime(2021, 3, 14);
t.Save();
new Track("song.mp3").Date;   // → 2021-01-01, expect
